From: =?UTF-8?q?Jerzy=20Ko=C5=82osowski?= <jerzy@kolosowscy.pl>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 21:50:53 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] plugins/screencast: Add D-Bus API for stream introspection
 and consumer tracking

Adds a D-Bus ObjectManager interface exposing active screencast streams
with real-time metadata including consumer application detection via
PipeWire graph traversal. Enables external applications to query which
screens/windows are being recorded and by which application.

Key features:
- D-Bus API on session bus (org.kde.KWin.ScreenCast)
- Per-stream objects with type-specific interfaces (Window/Output/Region)
- Asynchronous PipeWire consumer detection
- Comprehensive input validation and DoS protection
- Shared validation constants for security

API documentation included in DBUS_API.md with examples.
